# Frontend quality
- Verify 1440, 1024, 768 and 390 px layouts.
- No horizontal overflow.
- No clipped text or overflowing cards.
- Body copy should remain comfortably readable (generally 16px+).
- All interactive elements require keyboard operation and visible focus.
- Respect prefers-reduced-motion.
- Optimize images; use deliberate crops and object-position.
- Keep client JS minimal; prefer server-rendered content when possible.
- Run typecheck, lint and production build before completion.
